 - `headers`: Additional HTTP headers to be sent in the error response.
+- `type`: RFC 9457 problem type URI reference (only used with [`problemDetails`](#problem-details-rfc-9457)). Inherited from `cause` when it is a string.
+- `instance`: RFC 9457 URI reference identifying this occurrence (only used with `problemDetails`). Inherited from `cause` when it is a string.
